{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Hush 5G 可把兩部裝置變成私人嬰兒監視器，一次購買即可使用，無需訂閱、帳號，亦沒有廣告。適合需要在家或外出時留意寶寶動靜的家長，把舊手機或平板放在床邊就能當作寶寶端。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n\n\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-25.webp\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h2>雙機直連即時看護</h2>\n\n\n<p>把一部裝置放在嬰兒床旁作為寶寶端，另一部隨身作為家長端，影像與聲音經家中網絡直接傳送。支援即時視訊、雙向語音、可調靈敏度聲音提示，以及夜燈與白噪音等安撫音效。外出時家長端可經流動網絡連線，先以音訊節省數據；沒有 Wi-Fi 亦可透過熱點直連。</p>\n\n\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-28.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-29.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-30.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-31.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-32.jpg\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1179x2556bb-33.jpg\"/></figure></figure>\n\n\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Baby Monitor Hush 5G</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/baby-monitor-hush-5g/id6814606184?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.633629+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:12:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.635100+00:00","content_hash":"725200cd79f5d7d21a8331e0cba427df7f5e7a7ac0859177c1726fcd80170f1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}